</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P2259</idno><idno type="APIS">3839</idno><note type="comment">Van der Kuijp ([H9MPLMTV]) proposed the dates (?-1185). The terminus ante quem for gTsang nag pa's death was pushed to 1192 by Schwabland ([Q8WU9EDW]: 794, n. 3) on account of the date of Khro pu lo tsA ba (ID:3878)'s studies with gTsang nag pa. This date was corrected to 1195 based on Khro phu lo tsA ba's biography (van der Kuijp, personal communication).</note></person><person xml:id="person3868"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">pa tshab nyi ma grags</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">པ་ཚབ་ཉི་མ་གྲགས</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">pa tshab lo tsA ba nyi ma grags pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zhang pa tshab nyi ma grags</persName><birth notBefore="1055-01-01" notAfter="1055-12-31">1055</birth><death notBefore="1141-01-01">after 1141</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P5651</idno><idno type="APIS">3868</idno><note type="comment">Proposed dates: c. 1070-1145.</note></person><person xml:id="person3892"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sa skya paN+Di ta kun dga' rgyal mtshan</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ས་སྐྱ་པཎྜི་ཏ་ཀུན་དགའ་རྒྱལ་མཚན</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sa skya paṇḍita</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">chos rje sa paN</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">chos rje</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">chos kyi rje</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rigs gter gangs can mkhas pa'i gtsug rgyan</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sa paN</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sa skya lo tsA ba</persName><birth notBefore="1182-01-01" notAfter="1182-12-31">1182</birth><death notBefore="1251-01-01" notAfter="1251-12-31">1251</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P1056</idno><idno type="APIS">3892</idno><note type="comment">See [8S7FDMCJ]: 107 for a list of his most important disciples.</note></person><person xml:id="person3905"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">kun spangs thugs rje brtson 'grus</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཀུན་སྤངས་ཐུགས་རྗེ་བརྩོན་འགྲུས</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">kun spangs pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">jo nang gdan rabs 1</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">kun spangs chos rje</persName><birth notBefore="1243-01-01" notAfter="1243-12-31">1243</birth><death notBefore="1313-01-01" notAfter="1313-12-31">1313</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P858</idno><idno type="APIS">3905</idno><note type="comment">See [FEHIEFEB]: 134 on his life and studies.</note></person><person xml:id="person4608"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">brag ram pa shes rab 'bum</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">བྲག་རམ་པ་ཤེས་རབ་འབུམ</persName><birth notBefore="1183-01-01" notAfter="1303-12-31">after 1183 before 1303</birth><death notBefore="1253-01-01" notAfter="1383-12-31">after 1253 before 1383</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P3902</idno><idno type="APIS">4608</idno><note type="comment">Same person as dBu ma pa shes rab 'bum (ID:3903), as claimed in [S635TW6P]: 87?</note></person><person xml:id="person6042"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sangs rgyas bzang po</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">སངས་རྒྱས་བཟང་པོ</persName><birth notBefore="1210-01-01">after 1210</birth><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">6042</idno></person><person xml:id="person6640"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gtsang nags phug pa 'jam dbyangs shes rab 'od zer</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">གཙང་ནགས་ཕུག་པ་འཇམ་དབྱངས་ཤེས་རབ་འོད་ཟེར</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">nag phug pa 'jam dbyangs shes rab 'od zer</persName><birth notBefore="1200-01-01" notAfter="1270-12-31">after 1200 before 1270</birth><death notBefore="1245-01-01" notAfter="1350-12-31">after 1245 before 1350</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P9745</idno><idno type="APIS">6640</idno><note type="comment">Same person as "'jam gsar ba shes rab 'od zer" (ID:3884)?&#13;
Same person as "nag phug pa" (ID: 6639)?&#13;
